  MascotDialogue: 'Usually it takes hours to get this far, but you''ve been zooming
    through the ranks. You probably earned it through hard work. c:'
  AdText: GROW YOUR SPIRIT AND FINANCES
  OverrideDialogue:
  - OverrideDay: 1
    ReplacementDialogue: 'We''ve both come so far since you started!<n>

      I''ve
      really come out of my shell, and you''ve really opened your mind!<n>

      But
      now, I owe you a new secret!<n>

      Someday you''ll be sorted into either
      <color=blue>FLOCK</color> the <b>church</b> or <color=blue>FLOCK</color> the
      <b>business</b>.<n>

      Don''t worry, no matter which one is picked for
      you, it will be a happy and productive life or afterlife.<n>

      We''re
      always looking out for our Flock!<n>

      Just uhh-<n>

      Don''t be
      surprised if you end up on the business end.<n>

      Most people end up
      there...<n>

      <size=15>Especially the ones without wings.</size>'
